        esc_redemoinho_reator_op2:    "Keep the reactor running normally.",
        esc_redemoinho_reator_res1:   "The cables are safe, but the batteries drained and the radiation shield lost power too.",
        esc_redemoinho_reator_res2:   "The wind cleaned dust off the radiators and power went up, but flying pebbles scratched the base's outer shield.",

        esc_frio_extremo_titulo: "Freezing Night: -95 Degrees C",
        esc_frio_extremo_texto:  "It is winter on Mars. The cold is so strong that frost made of carbon dioxide (dry ice) is forming on the pipes between the greenhouse and the life support system.",
        esc_frio_extremo_op1:    "Heat the greenhouse first to save the plants.",
        esc_frio_extremo_op2:    "Heat the life support system first to keep air and water flowing.",
        esc_frio_extremo_res1:   "The plants survived, but the water valves of the life support system froze.",
        esc_frio_extremo_res2:   "Air and water are safe, but the cold burned half of the leaves in the greenhouse.",

        esc_ejecao_coronal_titulo: "Solar Radiation Storm",
        esc_ejecao_coronal_texto:  "A coronal mass ejection from the Sun is hitting Mars with radiation for hours, without warning. Mars has no magnetic field to protect the crew!",
        esc_ejecao_coronal_op1:    "Cover the roof with bags of wet Mars soil (regolith).",
