        esc_ejecao_coronal_res1:   "The soil bags made the shield much stronger, but they used water from the tanks.",
        esc_ejecao_coronal_res2:   "The shield held, but the reactor got worn out and used a lot of energy.",

        esc_ventos_expedicao_titulo: "Strong Winds Outside!",
        esc_ventos_expedicao_texto:  "The team on the expedition is far from the base when the wind suddenly picks up. They can barely see their own hands!",
        esc_ventos_expedicao_op1:    "Drop the heavy soil load and run back to the airlock.",
        esc_ventos_expedicao_op2:    "Drag the soil load back to the base, even in the storm.",
        esc_ventos_expedicao_res1:   "Everyone got back safe, but without the soil the shield could not be repaired.",
        esc_ventos_expedicao_res2:   "The soil made the shield stronger, but the suits got covered in toxic dust called perchlorate.",

        esc_filtro_zeolita_titulo: "Clogged CO2 Filter",
        esc_filtro_zeolita_texto:  "The machine that removes carbon dioxide from the air is full of Mars dust. If it stops, the air gets bad to breathe.",
        esc_filtro_zeolita_op1:    "Open the filter and clean it by hand.",
        esc_filtro_zeolita_op2:    "Heat the filter to the max to burn the dirt away.",
