        esc_safra_excedente_res1:   "Lots of food is stored for later, but the freezers use a lot of energy.",
        esc_safra_excedente_res2:   "The extra plants became fresh oxygen, and some food was saved too!",

        esc_gelo_cratera_titulo: "Ice Found at the Crater Rim!",
        esc_gelo_cratera_texto:  "The expedition's radar found pure ice under a layer of hard volcanic rock. Water ice is one of the most precious things on Mars!",
        esc_gelo_cratera_op1:    "Use the heavy electric drill from the base.",
