        evt_raios_cosmicos_titulo: "Cosmic Rays",
        evt_raios_cosmicos_texto:  "Cosmic rays are tiny bits of atoms flying super fast through space. Some come from the Sun and some from exploding stars far away. Mars has very thin air and no magnetic shield, so more of them reach the ground than on Earth.",

        evt_tempestade_poeira_titulo: "Dust Storm",
        evt_tempestade_poeira_texto:  "Strong winds lifted red dust high into the sky. The dust covers the solar panels, so they make less electricity. Some dust storms on Mars grow so big that they cover the whole planet!",

        evt_redemoinho_poeira_titulo: "Dust Devil",
