        evt_chuva_meteoritos_titulo: "Meteorite Shower",
        evt_chuva_meteoritos_texto:  "Small space rocks fell from the sky! On Earth, most of them burn up in the air, but Mars has very thin air, so more of them reach the ground. They can make new craters and damage the base.",

